cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AlgaMetrix in your work, please cite it as below."
title: AlgaMetrix
abstract: >-
  Open-source techno-economic analysis (TEA) and life-cycle assessment (LCA)
  for microalgae, cyanobacteria and aquatic protist biomass. Both analyses are
  derived from a single shared mass and energy balance, so the economic and the
  environmental results always describe the same process. Every organism,
  cultivation system, price and characterization factor lives in editable,
  citable YAML files.
type: software
